    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d602">

                <pb facs="0784" n="690" xml:id="pg690"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-10-20"><hi rendition="#italic">October 20,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Follow up tobacco order. Insist upon fulfillment of minister’s promise this week.
                    Cable when instructions go to Weyler and if possible what they are.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
